                                                                  to
                                                                  9,223,372,036,854,775,807

💰 DECIMAL         Exact decimals               Variable         M ≤ 65, D ≤ 30

📊 FLOAT           Approximate decimals         4 bytes          Approximately
                                                                  7 decimal digits

🔤 CHAR            Fixed-length text            Fixed            Maximum 255 characters

🔤 VARCHAR         Variable-length text         Variable         Up to 65,535 bytes*

📝 TEXT            Large text                   Variable         Maximum 65,535 bytes

📅 DATE            Date                         3 bytes          1000-01-01
                                                                  to 9999-12-31

⏰ TIME            Time / time interval         3 bytes          -838:59:59
                                                                  to 838:59:59

🕐 DATETIME        Date + time                  8 bytes          1000-01-01
                                                                  to 9999-12-31

🕐 TIMESTAMP       Date + time                  4 bytes          1970-01-01
                                                                  to 2038-01-19

✅ BOOLEAN         True / False                 1 byte*           0 / 1

📦 VARBINARY       Binary data                  Variable         Up to 65,535 bytes*


────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
⚠️ NOTES
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

🔹 VARCHAR(100) → Up to 100 characters, not necessarily 100 bytes.

🔹 DECIMAL(10,2) → 10 total digits, with 2 digits after the decimal.

🔹 CHAR(10) → Fixed-length text.

🔹 VARCHAR(10) → Variable-length text, up to 10 characters.

🔹 BOOLEAN in MySQL → Alias for TINYINT(1).

🔹 *Actual VARCHAR / VARBINARY limits depend on row size and character set.
